# M5b's stacked layout (plan section 6): under 900 px wide the page's grid is one column
# (FunctionViewer.module.css @media max-width 899px), the top bar over the panel over the plane,
# the plane at least 480 tall and the page scrolling when they don't fit. At 800 x 900 the panel
# is 768 wide and as tall as its cards, the plane under it reaching below the window; the top bar
# keeps the chip and the wordmark's text (hidden under 640 and 520). Shot at rest, unscrolled.
size 800 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot stacked
